# Hangar API docs at https://hangar.papermc.io/api-docs

### Latest release of a project for a platform and game version
GET https://hangar.papermc.io/api/v1/projects/ViaVersion/versions?channel=Release&platform=PAPER&platformVersion=1.21.4&limit=1

### Specific version by name
GET https://hangar.papermc.io/api/v1/projects/Maintenance/versions/5.1.1

### Project whose download is an external URL
GET https://hangar.papermc.io/api/v1/projects/Floodgate/versions?platform=PAPER&limit=1
